# One event of the vehicle, issued once when it happens: ``level`` one of ``EVENT_LEVELS`` (``info``, ``warning``, ``error``,
# ``critical``), ``part`` the label of the part or the API that it concerns, ``text_kind`` the kind of event as a word
# (``order_refused``, ``health_changed``, ``abort``, ``plan_state``), ``text`` the text of it. Issued for a refused order, a
# change of a monitor's or payload's health, an abort and a change of the plan's state (when the API's ``report_events`` is on).
#
# Frames (owner decision): positions NED about the scenario origin (x north, y east), body quantities FRD, angles in rad from
# north clockwise, time in s on the scenario clock.
